If ALL fail, findings is canned-422 (pure distractor). Let me batch a few (they're independent — all would 422 without side effects presumably... but if one SUCCEEDS it would add an item. Risk: item_count changes. But item_count is the thing I want to understand. Let me try ONE: {"severity": "high", "note": "x"}.

